<p>在vllm_ascend v0.11.0中，<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code>和<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_indices</code>本质上是同一个概念的不同表述，都表示<strong>输入token将要存储到KV缓存中的位置索引</strong> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:158-163</span> 。</p>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code>: 在元数据结构中定义的tensor，存储每个token的slot位置</li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_indices</code>: 在调用NPU算子时使用的参数名，实际传入的就是slot_mapping</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="group">位置定义  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. 数据结构中的位置  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code>定义在以下元数据类中：</p>
<p><strong>AscendMetadata类</strong> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:163</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>slot_mapping: torch.Tensor = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span></code></pre></pre>
<p><strong>AscendCommonAttentionMetadata类</strong> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">utils.py:172</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>slot_mapping=self.slot_mapping[:num_actual_tokens]</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">2. 使用位置  </h3>
<p>在attention的<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">reshape_and_cache</code>方法中，<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code>作为<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_indices</code>参数传递给NPU算子 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_cp.py:808-816</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>torch_npu._npu_reshape_and_cache(  
</span>    key=key[:num_decode_tokens],  
    value=value[:num_decode_tokens],  
    key_cache=self.key_cache,  
    value_cache=self.value_cache,  
    slot_indices=slot_mapping)</code></pre></pre>
<h2 class="group">获取方式  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. 主要计算方法  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code>通过<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">BlockTable.compute_slot_mapping()</code>方法计算 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">block_table.py:127-194</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">compute_slot_mapping</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self, req_indices: np.ndarray, positions: np.ndarray</span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span class="hljs-function">:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算逻辑：  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 1. 计算块表索引  </span><span>
</span>    block_table_indices = (req_indices * self.max_num_blocks_per_req *   
                          self.blocks_per_phys_block + logical_block_idx)  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 2. 获取块编号  </span><span>
</span>    block_numbers = self.block_table.np.ravel()[block_table_indices]  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 3. 计算块内偏移  </span><span>
